nd play, Inu-Oh is amazed to discover he has an incredible ability to dance. The two become inseparable. Tomona and Inu-Oh start sharing their talent with audiences. Their performances quickly gain acclaim and draw crowds. But why is Tomona blind? Why was Inu-Oh born looking like he does? A story about a legendary artist from 14th-century Japan, who defied fate to forge his own destiny. An anime in the form of a rock operetta with spectacular music and dance sequences.\n\n(Source: Warsaw Film Festival)\n\nNote: The film received an early premiere at the 78th Venice International Film Festival on September 9, 2021."},"tags":[{"name":"Band","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Musical Theater","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anachronism","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dancing","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rock Music","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Disability","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":80,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Curses","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crossdressing","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Acting","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":71,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Ghost","rank":70,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Samurai","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Demons","rank":57,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Inu-Oh","english":"Inu-Oh","native":"犬王","romaji":"Inu-ou","synonyms":[{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"平家物语：犬王"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"罗马字|Inu-ou"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"英文名|INU-OH"}]},"trailer":{"id":"1aWljU6ZDKU","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1aWljU6ZDKU/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}